7.880" end="00:28.390">pretend </span><span begin="00:28.390" end="00:28.510">that </span><span begin="00:28.510" end="00:28.600">I </span><span begin="00:28.600" end="00:28.900">didn't </span><span begin="00:28.900" end="00:29.590">care</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.590" end="00:31.540"><span begin="00:29.590" end="00:29.800">'Hey </span><span begin="00:29.800" end="00:30.370">Jessica</span><span begin="00:30.370" end="00:30.370">, </span><span begin="00:30.370" end="00:30.640">you're </span><span begin="00:30.640" end="00:30.970">so </span><span begin="00:30.970" end="00:31.540">funny</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.540" end="00:34.030"><span begin="00:31.540" end="00:31.900">You've </span><span begin="00:31.900" end="00:32.170">got </span><span begin="00:32.170" end="00:32.500">teeth </span><span begin="00:32.500" end="00:32.830">just </span><span begin="00:32.830" end="00:33.130">like </span><span begin="00:33.130" end="00:33.430">Bugs </span><span begin="00:33.430" end="00:34.030">bunny'</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.030" end="00:37.120"><span begin="00:34.030" end="00:34.480">Oh</span><span begin="00:34.480" end="00:34.480">, </span><span begin="00:34.480" end="00:34.930">so </span><span begin="00:34.930" end="00:35.140">you </span><span begin="00:35.140" end="00:35.590">think </span><span begin="00:35.590" end="00:35.770">you </span><span begin="00:35.770" end="00:36.130">know </span><span begin="00:36.130" end="00:36.400">me </span><span begin="00:36.400" end="00:37.120">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.150" end="00:39.940"><span begin="00:37.150" end="00:37.630">Have </span><span begin="00:37.630" end="00:37.930">you </span><span begin="00:37.930" end="00:38.830">forgotten </span><span begin="00:38.830" end="00:39.940">how</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.970" end="00:41.860"><span begin="00:39.970" end="00:40.330">You </span><span begin="00:40.330" end="00:40.600">would </span><span begin="00:40.600" end="