/span><span begin="00:53.650" end="00:54.100">jokes </span><span begin="00:54.100" end="00:54.400">Go </span><span begin="00:54.400" end="00:54.580">for </span><span begin="00:54.580" end="00:55.000">broke</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.000" end="00:56.920"><span begin="00:55.000" end="00:55.300">Blow </span><span begin="00:55.300" end="00:55.450">your </span><span begin="00:55.450" end="00:55.870">smoke </span><span begin="00:55.870" end="00:55.960">You're </span><span begin="00:55.960" end="00:56.320">not </span><span begin="00:56.320" end="00:56.920">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.950" end="00:59.320"><span begin="00:56.950" end="00:57.160">But </span><span begin="00:57.160" end="00:57.430">who's </span><span begin="00:57.430" end="00:57.880">laughing </span><span begin="00:57.880" end="00:59.320">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.350" end="01:01.990"><span begin="00:59.350" end="00:59.560">But </span><span begin="00:59.560" end="00:59.830">who's </span><span begin="00:59.830" end="01:00.280">laughing </span><span begin="01:00.280" end="01:01.990">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.560" end="01:04.600"><span begin="01:02.560" end="01:02.800">So </span><span begin="01:02.800" end="01:03.130">raise </span><span begin="01:03.130" end="01:03.250">the </span><span begin="01:03.250" end="01:03.670">bar </span><span begin="01:03.670" end="01:04.030">Hit </span><span begin="01:04.030" end="01:04.180">me </span><span begin="01:04.180" end="01:04.600">hard</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.600" end="01:06.520"><span begin="01:04.600" end="01:04.900">Play </span><span begin="01:04.900" end="01:05.050">your </span><span begin="01:05.050" end="01:05.500">cards </span><span begin="01:05.500" end="01:05.830">Be </span><span begin="01:05.830" end="01:05.920">a </span><span begin="01:05.920" end="01:06.520">star</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.920" end="01:12.370"><span begin="01:08.920" end="01:09.160">But </span><sp